      "text": "Empirical Verification through Manuscripts\n    Unlike other scriptures whose preservation depends on institutional control, the\nQurʾān declares divine self-preservation (Q 15:9). This promise is unique because the\nQurʾān is both the message and the object of protection—its very text being the\nmedium of revelation and the focus of divine safeguarding.\n        Archaeological evidence corroborates this stability:\n\n                                55",
