      "text": "Reason, Revelation and the Architecture of Truth\n\n     First-order claim         Scholarly finding          Consequence              Result\n\n Apostles preserved     Anonymous +       No recoverable,                                                                               Preservation\n  Jesus’ teaching         pseudonymous corpus   authorially unified Jesus-                                                                    becomes\n                                                   utterance corpus                                                                                   epistemically\n                                                                        undefined\n\nSecond-order Claim: Textual Plurality\n    Like the Hebrew Bible, after failing the preservation claim at the foundational\nlevel, the secondary manuscript record of the Christian Bible is the most diverse of\nany major religious corpus.57\nOld Testament (Christian use)\n    Christians inherited:\n    •   the Masoretic Text,\n    •   the Septuagint,\n    •  and sometimes Samaritan/Peshitta variants.\n   These differ in:\n    •   length of books\n    •   chronology\n    •   theological content\n    •  wording\nNew Testament Manuscripts\n   The New Testament exists in:",
