      "text": "About the Author\n       Azfar Samin is an independent researcher with an interest in religion,\nepistemology, systems thinking, and comparative worldview analysis. His work\nfocuses on examining truth claims from first principles, with particular attention to\ncoherence, correspondence with reality, and the conditions under which belief\nsystems can be judged consistently across a shared set of criteria.\n    As for his geolocation, he aspires to live in the city of Truth, and the land where\npeople follow what constrains them to it.",
