      "title": "Addenda to The Qur’an: A Complete Revelation — Sam Gerrans",
      "section": "Notepads [PDF p. 15]",
      "section_number": 14,
      "chunk_number": 5,
      "source_path": "research/articles/sam-gerrans-addenda-to-the-quran-a-complete-revelation.md",
