      "id": "sam-gerrans-addenda-to-the-quran-a-complete-revelation:s051:c03",
      "article_id": "sam-gerrans-addenda-to-the-quran-a-complete-revelation",
      "title": "Addenda to The Qur’an: A Complete Revelation — Sam Gerrans",
      "section": "Shayṭān, Jinn, and Related Terms Considered [PDF p. 52]",
      "section_number": 51,
